{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>You shall not go out for seven days.</b> The meaning is: they shall not engage in any other matter and shall not go to another place, but at night they go out for their needs. A parallel: <b>ויבכו את משה שלשים יום</b> — as if there was no moment when they did not weep. And similarly: <b>בסכת תשבו שבעת ימים</b>. And similarly: <b>ומן המקדש לא יצא</b>. <b>Completed, the order of the parashah of צו.</b>"], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:49.710196052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}